# Moddy Arena: a ready-made make aimed inside the arena lands there (the core's base_reach rule, with the arena as the
# player's base). No model anywhere: the Apprentice's local matcher offers the make.
@intent a player in Moddy Arena steps into the arena, aims at its floor and makes a house there with the Apprentice
@world flat seed=1

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s

@step into the arena
# he opens the gate in the shared wall and walks through it, onto the sandstone floor, looking north along it
@aim pos 0.5 64.5 16.5
@key key.use
@wait 10t
@assert execute if block 0 64 16 minecraft:oak_fence_gate[open=true]
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 45t
@wait 10t
@assert execute if entity @s[z=-15,dz=29]
@aim look 180 12
@wait 2s
@assert execute at @s if block ~ ~-1 ~ minecraft:smooth_sandstone
@shot aiming-into-the-arena

@step the Apprentice offers a house
moddy apprentice a cozy house
@expect screen Container within 10s
@shot apprentice-page

@step he presses the top tile and it lands
@click slot 0
@expect chat /is ready/ within 90s
@wait 3s
# the arena ahead of him is no longer empty air (compared with the empty sky at y 200): the house stands in it
@assert execute unless blocks -15 64 -15 15 67 8 -15 200 -15 all
@aim look 180 25
@wait 1s
@shot the-house-in-the-arena
